									Happy Holidays! - 
									12/23/2004 6:12:48 PM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									Since our last update, IL has taken down too many mobs to mention.&nbsp; Fennin Ro again, the Arbitor of Earth, Hulcror, Earth rings, Fire minis, Velitorkin, others I've forgotten.&nbsp; Gratz to all who got loot and flags!<br /> <br /> Gratz also to Zentix and Saphyre on their epics 1.5!<br /> <br /> Many new members have joined.&nbsp; Welcome!&nbsp; We're glad to have you with us.<br /> <br /> Finally, Happy Holidays to all.&nbsp; IL will be on a limited raiding schedule for the holiday period, so our members can spend some time with their <i>other</i> families.&nbsp; <br /> 
								</div>
