									Pyrique Torched; Icewind Iced - 
									12/23/2004 5:57:27 PM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									<img src="/pics/1693/tarn2.JPG" /><br /> I know it's been a while, but this still deserved its own item.&nbsp; Good job all on taking down both Pyrique Redwing and Tarn Icewind in our first attempt on each.&nbsp; <br /> 
								</div>
