									Friends Old and New - 
									12/3/2004 1:29:38 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									Gratz IL on taking down Hulcror for the first time!&nbsp; Congratulations to Elastar on <a href="http://lucy.allakhazam.com/item.html?id=70696">Hulcror's Whisker</a> and to Baiynnee on <a href="http://lucy.allakhazam.com/item.html?id=70690">Hulcror Hide Collar</a>.&nbsp; We'll definitely be seeing this guy again.<br /> <br /> After making a new friend, we stopped visited an old one.&nbsp; It was good to see him again, after so long:<br /> <br /> <img src="/pics/1693/Fennin%20Down.jpg" /><br /> <br /> Gratz to Zabas who got the <a href="http://lucy.allakhazam.com/item.html?id=14943">Immaculate Vest of the Fire Tyrant</a>, and to Cupie, who got IL's first <a href="http://lucy.allakhazam.com/item.html?id=24602">Ifir, Dagger of Fire</a>!&nbsp; We definitely won't go so long between visits to our old buddy Fennin again!<br /> <br /> And in keeping with the theme, welcome to our new friends who joined IL this week, and our old friends who came back again.&nbsp; It's great to have you all in the family!<br /> 
								</div>
